sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Caller
  participant G as Magpie
  participant H as MCP helper
  participant C as claude
  A->>G: Request + tools
  G->>C: stdin · JSON
  Note over C: Ask backend
  C->>H: tools/call
  H->>G: POST + run token
  G-->>A: Tool call · id
  Note over H,C: Wait for result
  Note over A: Run tool
  A->>G: Result · id
  G-->>H: Tool result
  H-->>C: MCP tool result
  C-->>G: stdout · JSON
  G-->>A: Response
